msgid ""
"Three-letter ISO code such as USD, EUR or GBP. Sent to your payment gateway "
"with every charge and used as the base for the currency switcher."
msgstr ""
"Code ISO à trois lettres tel que USD, EUR ou GBP. Envoyé à votre passerelle "
"de paiement à chaque prélèvement et utilisé comme base pour le sélecteur de "
"devise."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:705
msgid "Currency symbol"
msgstr "Symbole de devise"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:706
msgid "Printed with every price: $, €, £, kr and so on. Up to 10 characters."
msgstr "Imprimé avec chaque prix : $, €, £, kr, etc. Jusqu'à 10 caractères."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:715
msgid "Symbol position"
msgstr "Position du symbole"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:716
msgid "Before the amount gives $40.00; after gives 40.00$."
msgstr "Avant le montant donne $40.00 ; après donne 40.00$."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:719
msgid "Before the amount"
msgstr "Avant le montant"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:720
msgid "After the amount"
msgstr "Après le montant"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:727
msgid "Show the currency code with prices"
msgstr "Afficher le code devise avec les prix"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:728
msgid ""
"Prefixes every price with the code, e.g. USD $40.00. Helpful when you sell "
"to more than one country."
msgstr ""
"Préfixe chaque prix avec le code, par exemple USD $40.00. Utile si vous "
"vendez dans plusieurs pays."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:735
msgid "Decimal separator"
msgstr "Séparateur décimal"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:736
msgid ""
"Between whole units and fractions: a point in the US and UK, a comma across "
"most of Europe."
msgstr ""
"Entre les unités entières et les fractions : un point aux États-Unis et au "
"Royaume-Uni, une virgule dans la majeure partie de l'Europe."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:745
msgid "Thousands separator"
msgstr "Séparateur de milliers"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:746
msgid ""
"Between groups of three digits. Pick one that differs from the decimal "
"separator."
msgstr ""
"Entre les groupes de trois chiffres. Choisissez-en un différent du "
"séparateur décimal."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:756
msgid "Decimal places"
msgstr "Décimales"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:757
msgid ""
"Digits after the separator: 2 for most currencies, 0 for currencies such as "
"the yen."
msgstr ""
"Chiffres après le séparateur : 2 pour la plupart des devises, 0 pour des "
"devises comme le yen."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:766
msgid "Minus sign position"
msgstr "Position du signe moins"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:767
msgid ""
"For refunds and discounts: before the symbol gives -$5.00; after gives "
"$-5.00."
msgstr ""
"Pour les remboursements et les remises : avant le symbole donne -$5.00 ; "
"après donne $-5.00."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:771
msgid "Before the symbol"
msgstr "Avant le symbole"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:772
msgid "After the symbol"
msgstr "Après le symbole"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:784
msgid "Add currency"
msgstr "Ajouter une devise"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:786
msgid "Exchange rates"
msgstr "Taux de change"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:787
msgid ""
"Used only when a shopper switches currency with the currency widget. The "
"rate is how much of that currency one unit of your base currency buys. Leave "
"your base currency out."
msgstr ""
"Utilisé uniquement lorsqu'un acheteur change de devise avec le widget de "
"devise. Le taux indique combien de cette devise une unité de votre devise de "
